    `Regs related provision 2009 c 30 s 4 the number of weeks of benefits deemed to apply` `I am a claimant referred to in subsection 55(7) of the Regulations` `the weeks of regular benefits paid to me in the 260 weeks before my benefit period began` `the day on which my benefit period was established` `my years of contribution` `the number of weeks that would otherwise apply to me`
